# \file .dockerignore
# \brief Keep the Docker build context empty
#
# The Dockerfile copies nothing from the repo (compose mounts it instead), so send Docker
# an empty build context. Without this it would upload the whole Unity Library/ folder (GBs).
#
# \author Joel Chua (c.jialiang@digipen.edu)
# AI declaration: Claude Opus was used as a support tool for debugging, build infrastructure and the header comments.
# \date 2026-09-18
# \copyright 2026 DigiPen Institute of Technology Singapore. All rights reserved.

# "*" matches every file and folder, so nothing is sent.
*
